# The recorder's working directory: captured frames, browser profiles, the
# intermediate parts and the assembled master. 1.6 GB on a full shoot, all of it
# reproducible from scripts/film.ts. The finished film is published next to the
# app instead, so the URL in the README and the build cannot drift apart.
__film/

# Kiro must NOT be ignored - the repo root .kiro/ directory is a submission requirement.
!.kiro
